 ('"Pagi menghadap laut Selayar."', '"Mornings facing the Selayar sea."'),
 ('[("Kapasitas", "2 dewasa (maks. 3)"), ("Tempat tidur", "Queen"), ("Pemandangan", "Laut &amp; taman")]', '[("Capacity", "2 adults (max. 3)"), ("Bed", "Queen"), ("View", "Sea &amp; garden")]'),
 ('"Bungalow kayu yang sejuk dan bersih dengan atap tinggi dan teras pribadi yang luas menghadap laut. Nikmati kopi pagi sambil melihat ombak dari kursi santai, lalu berjalan ke pantai untuk menunggu senja. Kamar mandi dalam bernuansa bambu dengan lantai batu alam."',
  '"A cool, clean wooden bungalow with a high ceiling and a spacious private terrace facing the sea. Enjoy your morning coffee watching the waves from a lounge chair, then stroll to the beach to wait for the sunset. The en-suite bathroom has bamboo walls and a natural stone floor."'),
 ('"Rumah panggung di bibir Pantai Sunari."', '"A stilt house on the edge of Sunari Beach."'),
 ('[("Kapasitas", "2 dewasa (maks. 3)"), ("Tempat tidur", "King"), ("Pemandangan", "Laut atau taman")]', '[("Capacity", "2 adults (max. 3)"), ("Bed", "King"), ("View", "Sea or garden")]'),
 ('"Rumah panggung beratap rumbia di tepi Pantai Sunari, dengan kamar yang lebih luas dibanding Standard Bungalow. Teras pribadi menghadap ke arah matahari terbenam. Pada unit tepi pantai, senja tepat di depan mata. Kamar bernuansa kayu dengan lampu dinding temaram dan area wastafel dengan gantungan baju."',
  '"A thatched-roof stilt house by Sunari Beach, more spacious than the Standard Bungalow. The private terrace faces the setting sun, and in the beachfront units the sunset is right in front of you. A warm wooden room with soft wall lights and a washbasin area with clothes rack."'),
 ('"Rumah kayu A-frame di antara pohon kelapa."', '"A wooden A-frame among coconut palms."'),
 ('[("Kapasitas", "2 dewasa (maks. 3)"), ("Tempat tidur", "King"), ("Ekstra", "TV · loteng")]', '[("Capacity", "2 adults (max. 3)"), ("Bed", "King"), ("Extra", "TV · loft")]'),
 ('"Bungalow kayu beratap A-frame dengan loteng di bawah langit-langit kayu yang menjulang, lebih luas dibanding Standard dan VIP Standard. Keistimewaannya adalah kamar mandi semi-outdoor dengan rain shower, dikelilingi taman hijau dan langit terbuka. Teras kayu pribadi menghadap laut atau taman."',
  '"A wooden A-frame bungalow with a loft under a soaring timber ceiling, more spacious than the Standard and VIP Standard. Its highlight is a semi-outdoor bathroom with rain shower, surrounded by a green garden and open sky. The private wooden terrace looks out to the sea or garden."'),
 ('"Kelas tertinggi di SunaRi."', '"Our highest room category."'),
 ('[("Kapasitas", "2 dewasa (maks. 3)"), ("Tempat tidur", "King"), ("Ekstra", "Bathtub · air panas")]', '[("Capacity", "2 adults (max. 3)"), ("Bed", "King"), ("Extra", "Bathtub · hot water")]'),
 ('"Bungalow A-frame beratap rumbia dengan loteng dan jendela segitiga yang membiarkan cahaya pagi masuk. Kamar mandi semi-outdoor beratap kaca dengan <b>bathtub, rain shower dan air panas</b>, satu-satunya tipe kamar dengan air panas, untuk berendam air hangat dengan pohon kelapa tepat di atas kepala."',
  '"A thatched A-frame bungalow with a loft and a triangular window that lets in the morning light. The glass-roofed semi-outdoor bathroom has a <b>bathtub, rain shower and hot water</b>, the only room type with hot water, so you can enjoy a warm soak with coconut palms right above you."'),
 ('"Satu rumah, dua lantai, semua bersama."', '"One house, two floors, everyone together."'),
